{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>And He charged them.</b> He appointed them as officers, as in וַיִּסְמֹךְ אֶת יָדָיו עָלָיו וַיְצַוֵּהוּ (Numbers 27:23), and וְצִוְּךָ לְנָגִיד (1 Samuel 25:30), and others." "<b>Unto the children of Israel.</b> Over the children of Israel, as in אֶל הֶהָרִים לֹא אָכָל (Ezekiel 18:6)." "<b>And unto Pharaoh king of Egypt, to bring out.</b> And over Pharaoh king of Egypt He appointed them as officers regarding the matter of bringing Israel out of Egypt, so that Israel and also Pharaoh would hear, despite themselves, from Moses and Aaron, who were appointed over them by Him, blessed be He."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:24:39.697138981Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}